y/tail to overhang. Use the sitting/perch frames as references.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"horizontal-refine\",\"title\":\"Refine horizontal leap\",\"category\":\"jump\",\"priority\":\"normal\",\"tags\":[\"horizontal\",\"airborne\"],\"instructions\":\"Refine the approved AI horizontal flight pose. Keep a level back, forward head, trailing tail and gathered legs. Human pixel edits to the AI source make a mixed-origin frame; retain its lineage. No planted contact anchor while airborne.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"walk-head\",\"title\":\"Refine independent walk heads\",\"category\":\"walk\",\"priority\":\"normal\",\"tags\":[\"walk\",\"head-bob\"],\"instructions\":\"Review the high/low head combinations. Improve the head/neck seam if needed while leaving leg frames and every planted paw marker unchanged. Compare original and half-time head bobbing at the same walking speed.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"sitting-glance\",\"title\":\"Sitting head glance\",\"category\":\"idle\",\"priority\":\"later\",\"tags\":[\"sit\",\"look\"],\"instructions\":\"Explore a small head turn toward a nearby object without flipping the whole body. Audit the existing turn/idle catalogue before drawing new pixels; keep bearing paws in their source cells.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]}]}}}","etag":"82bc361330f4fc00bfb08842173f4f7be2c6bb35efd8c19b19af8820b4f40efb","customMetadata":{"projectId":"0d9340b1-6255-4d69-93b6-28d5077987e6","name":"Sitting · elevated · tail matrix","savedAt":"2026-10-14T21:01:25.843Z","ready":"0"}}